{"ref":"BDB, אָח³","hw":"אָח³","html":"† III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָח</span></big>  <strong>interj. (</strong>onomatop.<strong>) ah! alas!</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.11\">Ez 6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.20\">21:20</a>. iii. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָח</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.10\">Ez 18:10</a> (textual error). <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.10\">Ez 18:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אָח</span> is a <em>vox nihili</em> (dittogr. from foll. <span dir=\"rtl\">אחד</span>: v. Comm.): in <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.10\">21:10</a> also dub. (𝔊 εὖ), read <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ</span> Ew Hi Sm Toy, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדָּה</span> Co Berthol, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתְּ</span> Oort Krae.","next":"BDB, אַחֲלַי","prev":"BDB, אָח²"}